# Force LF in the repository for all text files.
#
# Why this matters here specifically: splits/*.json is hashed and the hash is the
# freeze fingerprint (DATA-18). If git rewrote line endings on checkout, the same
# manifest would produce a different SHA256 on Windows than on Linux and the
# freeze would be meaningless. See docs/environment.md ENV-10.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pt  binary
*.pth binary
*.safetensors binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
